{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_spark_toss","model_identifier":"spell_spark_toss","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_spark_toss\n\nGoblin spark toss: a small, dirty fire bolt about 15 cm (5 u), an uneven orange-and-yellow lump with a short sputtering tail behind (+Z). Smaller and dirtier than the mage fireball.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -2..2, y -2..2, z -3..10 units (0.14 x 0.13 x 0.34 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 8.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 5 x 4 x 12 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 3\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `loop` | 0.3 | loop | sputters: the lump tumbles unevenly |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_core, glow_lump, glow_lump_b, glow_sputter0, glow_sputter1, glow_sputter2\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"glow_lump","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.0,-1.5,-2.5],"to":[2.5,2.0,2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[5.0,0.0,9.5,3.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10.5,0.0,15.0,3.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[5.0,0.0,9.5,3.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10.5,0.0,15.0,3.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.5,4.5,5.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.5,4.5,5.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"078770e0-63c1-5235-a85e-b69b1113ff37"},{"name":"glow_lump_b","box_uv":false,"rescale"